cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Closed-Loop Telemetry and Judge-Guarded Self-Tuning for LLM Coding Agents"
abstract: >-
  A working system for turn-level telemetry across multiple LLM coding-agent runtimes,
  deterministic KPI scoring, a shadow-mode governor that learns per-turn model-tier / skill /
  compaction / delegation policy, and a nightly LLM-judged review that tunes the system's
  configuration from evidence. Includes a documented evaluator-contamination case study and fix.
authors:
  - family-names: Schaefer
    given-names: Carter
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-26"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - llm-agents
  - observability
  - self-tuning
  - reinforcement-learning
  - evaluation
